# CLAUDE.local.md — per-machine overlay. Claude Code loads this after CLAUDE.md.
# Copy this file to ~/.claude/CLAUDE.local.md and fill in your machine's facts.
# Do not commit it (it's gitignored). Delete the lines you don't use.

## This machine

- Shell: <PowerShell 5.1 / bash / zsh>
- Checkout of the MCPJam Inspector: <absolute path to your clone>
- `gh` authed as: <your GitHub handle>
- Available: <jq, rg, notify-send/mako, etc. — whatever your OS provides>
- If PowerShell: don't use `&&` between commands; chain with `;` or
  `if ($?) { ... }`. Set `$env:PYTHONIOENCODING="utf-8"` for Python that
  prints non-ASCII.
